WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.080
floated toward the new wall.

2
00:00:16.241 --> 00:00:18.541
Cautiously, he poked his head through.

3
00:00:19.482 --> 00:00:26.004
On the other side, he saw two construction workers and a bag—filled with the stolen Egyptian jewels!

4
00:00:31.212 --> 00:00:32.612
"Boo!" Ben shouted.

5
00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:34.573
The startled thieves jumped.

6
00:00:35.093 --> 00:00:36.093
"The ghost!"

7
00:00:36.694 --> 00:00:37.254
one cried.

8
00:00:38.254 --> 00:00:41.855
Both sprang to their feet and rushed out of a hidden door in the wall.

9
00:00:42.875 --> 00:00:43.835
"Stop, thieves!"

10
00:00:44.256 --> 00:00:45.276
Ben called after them.

11
00:00:46.036 --> 00:00:48.677
He floated after the workers as fast as he could.

12
00:00:50.037 --> 00:00:53.678
Crash! Just then Gaby burst through the construction area.

13
00:00:54.998 --> 00:01:00.700
The thieves were running for the front door, but Gaby tossed a big dinosaur bone in their path.

14
00:01:02.709 --> 00:01:05.371
"Ahh!" The workers screamed and turned around.

15
00:01:06.072 --> 00:01:07.773
They ran toward the Egyptian exhibit.

16
00:01:09.855 --> 00:01:11.857
Winnie swooped after them on her broom.

17
00:01:11.877 --> 00:01:13.438
"I'll get them!"

18
00:01:13.458 --> 00:01:16.401
"I'll try a halting spell!"

19
00:01:16.801 --> 00:01:18.102
Waldo waved his wand.

20
00:01:18.122 --> 00:01:23.767
"Duck!" one thief cried as the spell sailed toward him.

21
00:01:24.248 --> 00:01:26.190
The two thieves dove to the floor.

22
00:01:27.391 --> 00:01:31.789
Winnie steered downward, zooming faster than Ben had ever seen her fly.

23
00:01:32.509 --> 00:01:36.270
Crash! Her broom smashed into Uncle Tut's display case.

24
00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:38.831
Shattered glass flew everywhere.

25
00:01:39.751 --> 00:01:41.492
Waldo was waving his wand again.

26
00:01:42.272 --> 00:01:46.973
This time a spell zapped Uncle Tut, still sleeping inside the case.

27
00:01:48.433 --> 00:01:52.915
Sha-zam! The ancient mummy's body shook all over.

28
00:01:55.495 --> 00:01:59.401
His eyes sprang open, and he let out an angry growl.

29
00:02:05.923 --> 00:02:08.303
dares to disturb my rest?"

30
00:02:08.783 --> 00:02:09.484
he snarled.

31
00:02:10.224 --> 00:02:13.445
The two thieves were on the floor near the shattered display case.

32
00:02:13.465 --> 00:02:18.626
"Help!" they screamed as the old mummy walked over and grabbed them.

33
00:02:19.907 --> 00:02:23.688
Uncle Tut lifted both thieves at once and shook them hard.

34
00:02:25.216 --> 00:02:27.237
"Do not disturb the king!"

35
00:02:27.857 --> 00:02:28.597
he commanded.

36
00:02:28.617 --> 00:02:30.538
"We surrender!"

37
00:02:31.018 --> 00:02:31.939
the thieves cried.

38
00:02:31.959 --> 00:02:34.480
"We confess to everything."

39
00:02:36.481 --> 00:02:39.102
From inside her wrapping, Cleo was beaming.

40
00:02:39.122 --> 00:02:40.982
"Wow, Uncle Tut!"

41
00:02:41.403 --> 00:02:41.863
she said.

42
00:02:41.883 --> 00:02:43.543
"It's great to meet you!"

43
00:02:44.324 --> 00:02:47.205
The two museum guards suddenly raced into the room.

44
00:02:48.125 --> 00:02:51.447
Mr. Freaky was right behind them, looking very upset.

45
00:02:51.467 --> 00:02:54.468
"What in the world is going on here?"

46
00:02:54.944 --> 00:02:56.004
the principal cried.

47
00:02:56.805 --> 00:02:59.145
Ben grinned and pointed to Uncle Tut.

48
00:02:59.965 --> 00:03:01.946
The mummy was still clutching the thieves.

49
00:03:02.986 --> 00:03:04.167
"Uh, guess what, Mr.

50
00:03:04.227 --> 00:03:05.547
Freaky?" Ben said.

51
00:03:05.567 --> 00:03:08.908
"It looks like the mummy just wrapped up this case!"

52
00:03:14.669 --> 00:03:17.350
After the police took the thieves away, Mr.

53
00:03:17.410 --> 00:03:19.771
Freaky sank down on a bench in the lobby.

54
00:03:19.791 --> 00:03:23.792
"Everything is finally under control."

55
00:03:26.708 --> 00:03:33.033
"The construction workers were mad because I wouldn't pay them more," Dr.

56
00:03:33.053 --> 00:03:33.734
Bones said.

57
00:03:33.754 --> 00:03:38.458
"That's why they decided to steal the jewelry from the museum."

58
00:03:39.459 --> 00:03:42.702
"They knew we were coming here on a field trip," said Ben.

59
00:03:42.722 --> 00:03:46.265
"So they disguised themselves as zombies.

60
00:03:46.965 --> 00:03:49.727
That way, monsters would get blamed for the theft.

61
00:03:50.108 --> 00:03:53.371
Their plan almost worked!"

62
00:03:53.431 --> 00:03:54.792
Dr. Bones looked grateful.

63
00:03:55.840 --> 00:03:59.543
"Thank you, monsters, for helping to catch the thieves.

64
00:04:00.663 --> 00:04:07.588
The jewels are very valuable to the museum, and I owe all of you an apology."

65
00:04:07.608 --> 00:04:11.431
"Me too," Al Normal said sheepishly.

66
00:04:12.451 --> 00:04:13.352
He looked at Winnie.

67
00:04:14.913 --> 00:04:16.394
"You were right, young lady.

68
00:04:16.814 --> 00:04:18.856
Monsters are just like people."

69
00:04:19.976 --> 00:04:21.037
"I hope not!"

70
00:04:21.577 --> 00:04:22.738
Miss Bungle burst out.

71
00:04:24.099 --> 00:04:25.180
Everybody laughed.

72
00:04:31.093 --> 00:04:35.337
Dr. Bones turned to the ancient mummy, who had an arm around his niece.

73
00:04:36.498 --> 00:04:39.881
"I also want to apologize to you, Mr.

74
00:04:39.961 --> 00:04:42.663
Tut—er, Your Majesty.

75
00:04:43.464 --> 00:04:48.728
We would not have put you in that display if we'd known you were a live monster."

76
00:04:48.748 --> 00:04:52.532
"That's okay," Uncle Tut said.

77
00:04:53.284 --> 00:04:57.207
"Ruling an ancient kingdom is exhausting—I needed a rest.

78
00:04:58.268 --> 00:05:00.670
But now I have a lot of catching up to do.

79
00:05:01.490 --> 00:05:02.951
What century is this?"

80
00:05:03.752 --> 00:05:05.413
Cleo gave him a quick hug.

81
00:05:05.953 --> 00:05:08.835
"Wait till you meet my brothers and sisters, Uncle Tut!"

82
00:05:08.855 --> 00:05:13.839
"I'm sorry I was jealous of Cleo," Gaby whispered to Waldo.

83
00:05:13.859 --> 00:05:16.981
"I thought the two of you were sneaking out together last night.

84
00:05:17.422 --> 00:05:18.482
I should have trusted you."

85
00:05:19.203 --> 00:05:20.384
Waldo smiled at her.

86
00:05:21.652 --> 00:05:23.573
"It's a good thing you did get suspicious.

87
00:05:23.953 --> 00:05:25.194
You helped to stop the thieves."

88
00:05:26.214 --> 00:05:28.215
Dr. Bones was talking on her phone.

89
00:05:28.815 --> 00:05:30.756
A second later she clicked it off.

90
00:05:32.277 --> 00:05:35.738
"I just spoke with Mayor Hubbletree.

91
00:05:36.799 --> 00:05:40.781
We've agreed that this field trip was a huge success.

92
00:05:42.881 --> 00:05:45.703
Oh, and I have more good news."

93
00:05:46.403 --> 00:05:48.364
She flashed a smile at the monsters.

94
00:05:49.432 --> 00:05:58.475
"I believe I've convinced the mayor to send students from People Place to Monsterville for an overnight adventure!"

95
00:05:59.495 --> 00:06:01.115
All the monster kids cheered.

96
00:06:04.416 --> 00:06:08.637
The skeletons started rattling their bones and chanting, "Field trip!

97
00:06:08.997 --> 00:06:10.718
Field trip!"

98
00:06:10.738 --> 00:06:12.838
Mr. Freaky buried his face in his hands.

99
00:06:13.459 --> 00:06:16.760
"When will these field trips end?"

100
00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:18.000
he moaned.

101
00:06:18.832 --> 00:06:20.192
Winnie and Ben laughed.

102
00:06:20.212 --> 00:06:22.593
"Poor Mr.

103
00:06:22.693 --> 00:06:25.374
Freaky," Winnie said sympathetically.

104
00:06:26.394 --> 00:06:27.114
Ben nodded.

105
00:06:28.055 --> 00:06:30.495
A minute later he grabbed Winnie's hand.

106
00:06:34.236 --> 00:06:40.998
Together they ran outside, where the school bus was waiting to take everyone back to Monster Academy.

107
00:06:41.018 --> 00:06:44.799
"The field trip to People Place was fun," Ben thought.

108
00:06:44.819 --> 00:06:47.860
"But there's no place like Monsterville!"
